                  expression: SourceText[122:37@9186] "stored * (C_gate_drain * V_gd + depletion_charge(min(V_gd, 0), C_gate_drain_zero_bias, V_gate_drain_potential, gate_drain_grading, forward_bias_coefficient) + C_gate_drain_zero_bias * max(V_gd, 0))"
